          <h2 class="csd-h2">What is Custom Software Development?</h2>
          <p class="csd-lead">
            Off-the-shelf software forces your business to adapt its operating model to rigid third-party constraints. <strong>Custom software development</strong> engineers digital platforms tailored specifically around your unique business workflows, data models, and competitive edge.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="csd-benefits-grid">
          <!-- Benefit 1 -->
          <div class="csd-benefit-card">
